#: ../../../plus/debug-tools/_common_jtag_drivers.rst:20
msgid ""
"macOS contains default FTDIUSBSerialDriver driver which conflicts with debug "
"tools which are based on this chip. FTDI Chip company recommends removing "
"this default driver from a system. Everything should work after system "
"rebooting. See detailed instruction in official application note (Page 16, "
"Section 4: Uninstalling FTDI Drivers on OS X) `AN134: FTDI Drivers "
"Installation guide for MAC OS X <http://www.ftdichip.com/Support/Documents/"
"AppNotes/AN_134_FTDI_Drivers_Installation_Guide_for_MAC_OSX.pdf>`__"
msgstr ""

